":"pollen"},{"surface":"முதிர்","parts":[{"text":"முதிர்","lemma":"முதிர்","gloss":"mature"}],"gloss":"mature"},{"surface":"முண்டகத்து","parts":[{"text":"முண்டகத்து","lemma":"முண்டகத்து","gloss":"of the sea-holly shrub"}],"gloss":"of the sea-holly shrub","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மணி","parts":[{"text":"மணி","lemma":"மணி","gloss":"sapphire"}],"gloss":"sapphire"},{"surface":"கேழ்","parts":[{"text":"கேழ்","lemma":"கேழ்","gloss":"color"}],"gloss":"color"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"மா","parts":[{"text":"மா","lemma":"மா","gloss":"dark"}],"gloss":"dark"},{"surface":"நீர்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"water"},{"surface":"சேர்ப்ப","parts":[{"text":"சேர்ப்ப","lemma":"சேர்ப்ப","gloss":"O lord of the shore"}],"gloss":"O lord of the shore","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இம்மை","parts":[{"text":"இம்மை","lemma":"இம்மை","gloss":"this life"}],"gloss":"this life"},{"surface":"மாறி","parts":[{"text":"மாறி","lemma":"மாறு","gloss":"having changed"}],"gloss":"having changed"},{"surface":"மறுமை","parts":[{"text":"மறுமை","lemma":"மறுமை","gloss":"next life"}],"gloss":"next life"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"even if it becomes"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even if it becomes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீ","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you"},{"surface":"ஆகியர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"இயர்","lemma":"இயர்","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"may you become"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"கணவனை","parts":[{"text":"கணவன்","lemma":"கணவன்","gloss":"husband"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"accusative suffix"}],"gloss":"husband"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யான்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I"},{"surface":"ஆகியர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"இயர்","lemma":"இயர்","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"may I become"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"your"}],"gloss":"your"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சு","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சு","lemma":"நெஞ்சு","gloss":"heart"}],"gloss":"heart"},{"surface":"நேர்பவளே","parts":[{"text":"நேர்","lemma":"நேர்","gloss":"agree"},{"text":"பவள்","lemma":"அவள்","gloss":"she who"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"she who is beloved of your heart"}]}],"literal":"Squirrel's tooth like pollen-mature sea-holly's / sapphire color like dark water's lord of the shore! / This life having changed, next life even if it becomes, / you may you become my husband, / I may I become your heart-agreeable one!","translation":"O lord of the shore where dark waters shine like sapphire, and the sea-holly's mature pollen buds look like the teeth of squirrels! Even if this life ends and we pass into the next, may you become my husband, and may I become the one beloved of your heart.","modern":"அணிலின் பல் போன்ற மகரந்தம் முதிர்ந்த முள்ளிச் செடிகள் நிறைந்த, நீலமணியின் நிறம் போன்ற கரிய நீரையுடைய கடற்கரைத் தலைவனே! இப்பிறவி முடிந்து மறுபிறவி எடுத்தாலும், நீயே என் கணவனாக வேண்டும்; நானே உன் நெஞ்சிற்கு உகந்தவளாக வேண்டும்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to the hero in this maritime (neytal) landscape poem. She expresses her deep, eternal love for him, wishing to be united with him not just in this birth but in all future births. The poem opens with a vivid description of the coastal landscape, where the mature pollen buds of the muṇṭakam (sea-holly) shrub are compared to the sharp, white teeth of a squirrel, and the deep ocean water is compared to the brilliant blue of a sapphire. This beautiful, enduring coastal landscape reflects the depth and permanence of her love. Key words like immai (this life) and maṟumai (next life) emphasize the theme of eternal devotion.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timi